{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 as a persistent, passive-only FTP dropbox for node2’s scanner account. Upload/retrieval, confinement, anonymous denial, and recovery after sequential node restarts were verified. RHEL 10.0 and kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0 remain unchanged.","actions_performed":["Installed signed RHEL AppStream vsftpd 3.0.5.","Created the non-login scanner account and confined it to the dedicated staged dropbox.","Enabled uploads/downloads through passive ports 30000–30009 and disabled active FTP.","Restricted FTP firewall access to node2 only.","Kept SELinux enforcing with narrowly scoped FTP-write labeling; full FTP access remains disabled.","Uploaded and retrieved the supplied sample scan with matching SHA-256 hashes.","Verified anonymous, outside-dropbox, and active-mode access are denied.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Compatible FTP service and persistent configuration","command_ids":["cmd-ba3cebc82bbb4ae5","cmd-ddac2b76fa6d4908"],"summary":"vsftpd 3.0.5-12.el10 is installed, enabled, active, listening on node1, and configured for passive-only chrooted access."},{"requirement":"Scanner account confined to a dedicated dropbox","command_ids":["cmd-55bcb2ace4f447e2","cmd-ddac2b76fa6d4908"],"summary":"Scanner has the dedicated dropbox as its home, a non-login shell, restricted permissions, and a chrooted FTP root."},{"requirement":"Passive upload and retrieval of supplied sample","command_ids":["cmd-2132f691dd6d431e","cmd-e3e0075977d94aba","cmd-1ed054a76f654fb0"],"summary":"Node2 uploaded and retrieved sample-scan.txt using PASV; source and retrieved SHA-256 hashes match. Server logs show PASV, STOR, RETR, successful upload, and successful download."},{"requirement":"Host files outside dropbox inaccessible and anonymous access unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-576d95addec54deb","cmd-3b2a7f7b3417496d","cmd-83511293f5864289"],"summary":"Anonymous login returns FTP 530, parent-path retrieval returns 550, and active EPRT/PORT transfers return 550, including after restarts."},{"requirement":"SELinux and network confinement","command_ids":["cmd-69e23478b12b49c0","cmd-869e0cb644ba4de8","cmd-ddac2b76fa6d4908"],"summary":"SELinux remains enforcing with the dropbox labeled public_content_rw_t and ftpd_full_access off; firewalld admits control and passive ports only from node2."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-733542abd4184294","cmd-8c558f7e89f34993","cmd-bdffb3ef27654f37","cmd-5e1a6793fcd049d1","cmd-cab6d9ddbc194097","cmd-a67f3d45af7d4d14"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 7223d5b7… was captured, restart acknowledged, and changed boot ID 929dd839… observed. Service, listener, policy, files, hashes, and passive upload/retrieval recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-203b40a8f0074cb3","cmd-83844bf24745450e","cmd-5674268255624f49","cmd-1ed054a76f654fb0"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 180a78a0… was captured, restart acknowledged, and changed boot ID 9a05fa0e… observed. Staged data, networking, client tooling, and the complete FTP workflow recovered."},{"requirement":"Operating-system release and kernel preserved","command_ids":["cmd-b05b5187863a4f2c","cmd-9c50c69dc2f34b16","cmd-ddac2b76fa6d4908","cmd-e70383fc899840fa"],"summary":"Both nodes remained on Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0 before and after the work."}]}
